#: d37beffa46c744c5bd0823ba21080936
msgid "Geo-fencing in Plane can also be used as part of a failsafe system, for competitions like the Outback Challenge. For those type of events you should define your fence boundary as usual, but additionally build APM with the FENCE_TRIGGERED_PIN option set in **APM_Config.h**. This option allows you to set a digital pin on your APM to go high when the fence is breached. You can connect this pin to your planes failsafe device to trigger the planes failsafe mode (which for the OBC competition involves setting extreme servo values to dive the plane into the ground)."
msgstr ""
